1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,900
=Episode 8=

4
00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:44,500
(The Day of the Peony Festival;
Upright and Honorable)

5
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:34,700
(Cuiyun Tower)

6
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:44,940
(Cuiyun Tower)

7
00:03:02,620 --> 00:03:04,500
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

8
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:09,020
(Mingde Gate)

9
00:03:09,020 --> 00:03:10,420
The year the seven
Military Governors rebelled,

10
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:12,100
my whole family was killed.

11
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:14,260
I was forced into a life of degradation.

12
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:17,740
Ten years have passed.

13
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:20,700
No one's ever lifted a finger
to help me,

14
00:03:21,860 --> 00:03:23,260
let alone buy my freedom.

15
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:25,020
We've both fallen on hard times.

16
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:26,220
Miss,

17
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:28,020
you must leave now.

18
00:03:30,140 --> 00:03:31,300
But if I leave today,

19
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:33,260
what will happen to you?

20
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:35,140
If Zhang Renjing finds out

21
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:36,900
you bought my freedom,

22
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:37,420
then...

23
00:03:37,420 --> 00:03:37,900
Don't worry.

24
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:40,540
I'll find a way out.

25
00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:43,020
Just leave Sheng'an,

26
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:45,580
so he can never bother you again.

27
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:47,860
You've saved me twice.

28
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:50,100
I'm deeply in your debt.

29
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:53,940
I'll repay you in my next life.

30
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:55,260
All I wish is

31
00:03:55,940 --> 00:03:56,700
that you can live freely

32
00:03:57,420 --> 00:03:58,340
from now on.

33
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:14,200
(Mingde Gate)

34
00:04:24,420 --> 00:04:24,940
(Mr. Zhang!)

35
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:25,780
(It's been a while.)

36
00:04:25,780 --> 00:04:26,340
(Nice to see you both!)

37
00:04:26,340 --> 00:04:31,180
(Sigui Garden)

38
00:04:36,780 --> 00:04:37,180
Captain,

39
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:38,380
sorry for the wait.

40
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:41,460
What took you so long?

41
00:04:41,620 --> 00:04:42,740
I've waited ages.

42
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:44,300
I came on foot,

43
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:45,140
so I'm a little late.

44
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:47,700
The private room is ready.

45
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:51,980
It's ready?

46
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:54,260
Please follow me.

47
00:04:58,780 --> 00:04:59,260
This way.

48
00:05:11,260 --> 00:05:11,660
Where is she?

49
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:13,980
Please wait, Captain.

50
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,740
Just a little longer.

51
00:05:16,140 --> 00:05:17,020
I'll let you know

52
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:18,700
as soon as Xu Mianmian's here.

53
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:20,580
What a hassle.

54
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:22,340
Tell her to hurry up!

55
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:22,780
Got it.

56
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:23,900
I'll go check.

57
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:32,420
Captain,

58
00:05:33,020 --> 00:05:33,620
what's this?

59
00:05:34,340 --> 00:05:34,740
Well...

60
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:39,340
I paid a lot for this
from foreign traders.

61
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:40,780
It's powerful.

62
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:45,300
You wouldn't understand.

63
00:05:45,660 --> 00:05:46,140
Go on!

64
00:05:46,660 --> 00:05:46,980
Yes, sir.

65
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:56,140
Excuse me.

66
00:05:56,140 --> 00:05:57,420
(What a grand procession!)

67
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:58,540
(Magnificent!)

68
00:05:58,540 --> 00:06:00,380
(I've never seen
such a splendid carriage!)

69
00:06:20,580 --> 00:06:22,980
When will the Peony Goddess rite
be over?

70
00:06:23,740 --> 00:06:24,740
(Jin Bu, Imperial Sacrifice Official)
Your Highness,

71
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:26,420
it ends at noon.

72
00:06:30,140 --> 00:06:30,580
Good.

73
00:06:36,980 --> 00:06:38,260
(Why not compose a poem?)

74
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:38,900
(Exactly!)

75
00:06:38,900 --> 00:06:39,820
(It'd add to the fun.)

76
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:41,700
(Let's just admire the flowers.)

77
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:52,340
(Such fine blooms)

78
00:06:52,780 --> 00:06:54,260
(are rare to see outside.)

79
00:06:55,860 --> 00:06:57,820
(They must've been carefully tended.)

80
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:05,100
Your Highness,

81
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:06,900
go ahead and pray to the Peony Goddess.

82
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:07,940
I'll excuse myself for a moment.

83
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:09,740
But we haven't...

84
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:12,060
Go enjoy yourself, too.

85
00:07:17,420 --> 00:07:18,340
(Let's look over here.)

86
00:07:18,420 --> 00:07:18,740
(All right.)

87
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:22,540
Yan Shang.

88
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:30,900
Your Highness.

89
00:07:32,340 --> 00:07:33,380
What brings you here?

90
00:07:34,740 --> 00:07:35,260
What's wrong?

91
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:37,180
Am I not allowed at this festival?

92
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:39,780
I just...

93
00:07:40,740 --> 00:07:41,420
never expected

94
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:43,460
to see you again so soon.

95
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:46,900
Since I've run into you,

96
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:49,220
show me around the garden.

97
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:52,820
Your Highness, I have things to do.

98
00:07:53,300 --> 00:07:54,620
What could be more important than me?

99
00:07:56,340 --> 00:07:56,660
Come.

100
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:06,340
(Candied fruit, plums, and apricots!)

101
00:08:06,620 --> 00:08:07,180
This one looks nice.

102
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:08,740
We'll take it.

103
00:08:09,980 --> 00:08:10,340
This one.

104
00:08:10,940 --> 00:08:11,220
And this one.

105
00:08:11,220 --> 00:08:12,540
(Sweet and sour. Delicious!)

106
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:18,060
This one, too!

107
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:20,540
Pay up.

108
00:08:22,260 --> 00:08:22,540
Here.

109
00:08:27,820 --> 00:08:28,300
Miss,

110
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:30,020
get some Peony Goddess knots.

111
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:31,100
Tie them around your wrists

112
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:32,660
for good luck and good health.

113
00:08:32,860 --> 00:08:33,540
The Peony Goddess will bless you.

114
00:08:34,620 --> 00:08:35,180
I'll take them all.

115
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:37,380
Peony Goddess knots!

116
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:39,220
Help me tie it.

117
00:08:39,220 --> 00:08:40,780
(Pretty sachets and purses!)

118
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:42,140
(All handmade.)

119
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:44,260
(Ladies, come take a look.)

120
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:45,660
Thank you.

121
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:46,820
(Sachets and purses!)

122
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:49,580
(Pretty sachets and purses!)

123
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:54,100
There.

124
00:08:54,260 --> 00:08:54,700
Does it look good?

125
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:56,540
Of course.

126
00:08:58,340 --> 00:08:59,580
You're not even paying attention.

127
00:09:02,900 --> 00:09:03,500
(Twenty copper coins.)

128
00:09:29,620 --> 00:09:30,780
What are you doing?

129
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:36,220
Tired of showing me around?

130
00:09:36,860 --> 00:09:37,340
I wouldn't dare.

131
00:09:38,900 --> 00:09:39,540
Keep up.

132
00:09:44,700 --> 00:09:45,180
Yan Shang,

133
00:09:46,820 --> 00:09:47,900
this garden is huge.

134
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:49,180
What's your favorite spot?

135
00:09:50,540 --> 00:09:52,820
There's an old stone well
in the northwest corner.

136
00:09:53,260 --> 00:09:54,020
The clear water

137
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:56,020
reflects the clouds and trees.

138
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:57,580
It's peaceful and lovely.

139
00:09:58,740 --> 00:09:59,380
Not my kind of place.

140
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:02,700
(Trinkets and knickknacks!)

141
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:03,620
Let's look over there.

142
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:07,220
(Lovely things! Come take a look!)

143
00:10:07,420 --> 00:10:08,300
(Miss, have a look!)

144
00:10:08,820 --> 00:10:09,380
Tired from walking?

145
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:15,340
Shall we take a break?

146
00:10:18,420 --> 00:10:18,860
Yan Shang,

147
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:22,100
your story last night was bad enough.

148
00:10:23,420 --> 00:10:23,940
Today,

149
00:10:24,700 --> 00:10:25,940
don't upset me again.

150
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:42,980
Chunhua.

151
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:47,900
This is for you.

152
00:10:57,220 --> 00:10:57,820
Lip rouge?

153
00:10:59,580 --> 00:11:00,620
Just something I picked up.

154
00:11:00,940 --> 00:11:01,740
I don't know much about these things.

155
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:03,180
If you don't like it,

156
00:11:03,340 --> 00:11:03,900
throw it away.

157
00:11:09,780 --> 00:11:10,220
And this.

158
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:12,420
And this.

159
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:14,380
And this.

160
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:16,580
These earrings, too.

161
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:26,460
Hope you like them.

162
00:11:27,340 --> 00:11:27,980
All right.

163
00:11:28,380 --> 00:11:29,060
Stop pulling things out.

164
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:29,940
I can't carry all this.

165
00:11:34,580 --> 00:11:35,100
Liu Wenji,

166
00:11:35,660 --> 00:11:36,340
I need to ask you something.

167
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:37,940
Go ahead.

168
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:39,140
Do you like me?

169
00:11:57,900 --> 00:11:58,380
Liu Wenji,

170
00:11:58,900 --> 00:11:59,700
I do like you.

171
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:01,460
If you like me too,

172
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:02,820
will you marry me?

173
00:12:12,060 --> 00:12:12,620
Chunhua...

174
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:16,500
My father

175
00:12:17,180 --> 00:12:18,460
always told me

176
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:21,340
that I should earn honors,

177
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:23,380
pass the imperial exam,

178
00:12:24,420 --> 00:12:24,940
and...

179
00:12:28,420 --> 00:12:28,980
and...

180
00:12:32,900 --> 00:12:34,100
marry...

181
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:37,820
a woman of noble birth.

182
00:12:53,340 --> 00:12:53,860
But, Chunhua,

183
00:12:54,260 --> 00:12:55,060
that's not what I want.

184
00:12:56,620 --> 00:12:57,380
I like you.

185
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:06,500
I'll make you my wife.

186
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:17,620
It's a promise, then.

187
00:13:34,780 --> 00:13:35,220
Thank you.

188
00:13:36,020 --> 00:13:37,620
(Look, isn't this the lot we wanted?)

189
00:13:39,180 --> 00:13:39,540
Go ahead.

190
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:40,020
(Exactly!)

191
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:45,180
They say the peony lots here never miss.

192
00:13:45,660 --> 00:13:46,020
Try one.

193
00:13:46,860 --> 00:13:47,580
Your Highness, please.

194
00:13:48,420 --> 00:13:49,260
You draw first.

195
00:13:50,340 --> 00:13:51,700
I don't believe in fortune-telling.

196
00:13:52,700 --> 00:13:53,260
(You two in front!)

197
00:13:53,780 --> 00:13:54,300
(Are you drawing or not?)

198
00:13:55,700 --> 00:13:56,220
Hurry up!

199
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:02,220
(A phoenix heralds a new age;
the moon lights her lonely path)

200
00:14:13,740 --> 00:14:15,780
(Great statecraft draws vast wisdom;
the heavens await mending at court.)

201
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:17,140
The court...

202
00:14:19,020 --> 00:14:21,020
Seems you'll hold
the highest office one day.

203
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:23,580
In that case,

204
00:14:24,020 --> 00:14:24,940
this lot must be wrong.

205
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:26,180
Governing is hard enough,

206
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:28,300
(A phoenix heralds a new age.)
let alone "mending the heavens."

207
00:14:29,460 --> 00:14:30,340
What did you draw?

208
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:31,820
Not telling you.

209
00:14:32,660 --> 00:14:33,340
Didn't you say it doesn't count?

210
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:55,980
(Retreat of Grace)

211
00:15:11,820 --> 00:15:12,260
(Wonderful!)

212
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:13,140
(Wonderful!)

213
00:15:17,180 --> 00:15:19,900
(Retreat of Grace)

214
00:15:26,460 --> 00:15:29,300
(Retreat of Grace)

215
00:15:40,900 --> 00:15:42,940
(The Peony Goddess rite is almost over.)

216
00:16:12,340 --> 00:16:13,220
Princess Danyang is over there.

217
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:19,900
Her stuff.

218
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:37,060
(So beautiful!)

219
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:38,660
(Indeed!)

220
00:16:41,020 --> 00:16:42,380
(I've never seen peonies like these!)

221
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:44,620
Yan Shang, look!

222
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:45,260
Wanyao!

223
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:47,900
You scared me half to death!

224
00:16:48,380 --> 00:16:48,980
Where's Yan Shang?

225
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:51,060
Wanyao,

226
00:16:51,820 --> 00:16:52,500
when did you get here?

227
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:53,300
Where do you want to go next?

228
00:16:53,460 --> 00:16:53,820
I'll come with you.

229
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:54,660
I've told you,

230
00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:55,780
don't call me Wanyao.

231
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:57,460
Coming through!

232
00:17:17,020 --> 00:17:17,540
What is it?

233
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:20,500
Her Highness wants you
to fetch some wine

234
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:21,740
and wait for her in the room.

235
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:23,380
How did you know?

236
00:17:26,220 --> 00:17:27,340
You can ask me anything.

237
00:17:27,780 --> 00:17:28,380
However,

238
00:17:28,860 --> 00:17:30,420
when you're serving Her Highness,

239
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:32,220
ask fewer questions.

240
00:17:35,660 --> 00:17:36,700
Thank you for the advice.

241
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:38,020
I'll fetch the wine now.

242
00:17:47,700 --> 00:17:49,180
(Jifu)

243
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:57,140
(Jifu)

244
00:17:59,780 --> 00:18:00,380
(Jifang)
I've heard

245
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:02,980
Grand Princess Luling
has a private pavilion in the garden.

246
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:04,660
Which one is it?

247
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:06,980
Whenever the Grand Princess
comes to see the flowers,

248
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:08,700
she takes over Jifang Pavilion.

249
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:10,140
(Jifang)

250
00:18:15,380 --> 00:18:20,740
(Jifu)

251
00:18:37,180 --> 00:18:38,140
Captain, sorry to keep you waiting.

252
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:38,980
Let's go.

253
00:18:39,820 --> 00:18:40,580
I'll take you there.

254
00:18:40,580 --> 00:18:41,260
Move it.

255
00:18:45,260 --> 00:18:45,900
This way.

256
00:18:47,300 --> 00:18:48,580
The Jifu Pavilion.

257
00:18:49,460 --> 00:18:50,380
Wait here, Captain.

258
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:52,180
Miss Xu will be here soon.

259
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:56,340
(Jifang)

260
00:18:58,780 --> 00:19:00,580
(Jifu)

261
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:03,020
Fu...

262
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:05,140
(Jifu)

263
00:19:05,940 --> 00:19:06,740
I know this character.

264
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:08,820
Fu means good fortune!

265
00:19:17,100 --> 00:19:18,020
(Jifu)

266
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:23,300
(Jifang)

267
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:46,500
That idiot!

268
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:48,300
He's actually fallen asleep!

269
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:51,420
And he still expects a promotion?

270
00:19:52,340 --> 00:19:53,740
Wake him up!

271
00:19:53,740 --> 00:19:54,180
- Yes!
- Yes!

272
00:20:03,620 --> 00:20:05,060
Who's this old man?

273
00:20:14,780 --> 00:20:15,420
Wake up!

274
00:20:41,700 --> 00:20:43,020
How dare you!

275
00:20:43,420 --> 00:20:44,980
Look at yourself!

276
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:46,740
How dare you offend me?

277
00:20:47,140 --> 00:20:47,980
Kill him!

278
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:56,420
Seize him!

279
00:20:57,380 --> 00:20:58,780
Seal off the entire garden!

280
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:00,380
Until that filthy wretch is caught,

281
00:21:00,740 --> 00:21:01,780
no one is leaving!

282
00:21:10,420 --> 00:21:10,820
(Over there!)

283
00:21:11,620 --> 00:21:12,100
(He's over there!)

284
00:21:20,980 --> 00:21:21,500
(What's happening?)

285
00:21:21,500 --> 00:21:21,820
(Take him away!)

286
00:21:23,620 --> 00:21:23,940
(Move!)

287
00:21:28,140 --> 00:21:28,500
Captain!

288
00:21:29,020 --> 00:21:29,580
Run!

289
00:21:33,140 --> 00:21:33,420
Hurry!

290
00:21:34,980 --> 00:21:35,860
Captain, we're in deep trouble!

291
00:21:36,260 --> 00:21:37,020
I'll get you out of here.

292
00:21:37,380 --> 00:21:37,700
Hurry!

293
00:21:51,900 --> 00:21:52,420
What's going on?

294
00:22:13,220 --> 00:22:13,860
Get me out.

295
00:22:31,020 --> 00:22:31,780
Quiet.

296
00:22:32,700 --> 00:22:34,420
At that ruined temple in Chuzhou,

297
00:22:34,860 --> 00:22:35,780
it was you

298
00:22:36,140 --> 00:22:38,700
who slashed my father's knees!

299
00:22:41,900 --> 00:22:42,540
Your men

300
00:22:43,300 --> 00:22:44,420
killed my little brother.

301
00:22:45,860 --> 00:22:47,580
You slit my mother's throat.

302
00:22:48,060 --> 00:22:48,940
And my eldest brother

303
00:22:50,060 --> 00:22:52,100
was crippled for life.

304
00:22:53,260 --> 00:22:55,380
They suffered a thousand times more

305
00:22:56,820 --> 00:22:57,700
than you!

306
00:24:04,300 --> 00:24:05,060
Zhang Renjing,

307
00:24:06,740 --> 00:24:07,780
did you ever think

308
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:10,300
this day would come?

309
00:25:08,140 --> 00:25:13,100
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart♪

310
00:25:13,100 --> 00:25:17,380
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

311
00:25:17,660 --> 00:25:22,240
♪Books bear no blade♪

312
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:26,580
♪Yet tens of thousands of scrolls
can pierce the sky♪

313
00:25:27,820 --> 00:25:31,980
♪My body is the furnace,
flames reach the clouds♪

314
00:25:32,290 --> 00:25:37,180
♪Winds gather, then drift apart♪

315
00:25:37,580 --> 00:25:41,420
♪I see no court, only a boundless world♪

316
00:25:41,780 --> 00:25:46,220
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

317
00:25:46,860 --> 00:25:51,420
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

318
00:25:51,940 --> 00:25:55,860
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

319
00:25:56,100 --> 00:26:00,620
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

320
00:26:01,540 --> 00:26:05,300
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

321
00:26:06,180 --> 00:26:10,780
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

322
00:26:11,180 --> 00:26:14,660
♪I'll take the open road
and journey home♪

323
00:26:15,580 --> 00:26:20,300
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

324
00:26:20,980 --> 00:26:24,540
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

325
00:26:38,220 --> 00:26:38,980
(By order of the Grand Princess,)

326
00:26:39,260 --> 00:26:40,380
(no one may leave the garden.)

327
00:26:40,580 --> 00:26:41,220
(Violators will be arrested!)

328
00:26:42,740 --> 00:26:44,100
There's been a murder in the garden.

329
00:26:44,940 --> 00:26:45,940
As a judicial officer,

330
00:26:46,300 --> 00:26:46,820
I must investigate.

331
00:26:48,100 --> 00:26:48,740
Go on.

332
00:26:54,020 --> 00:26:55,780
(The snake's head and the hornet)

333
00:26:56,580 --> 00:26:57,740
(were crushed beneath the wheel.)

334
00:26:58,380 --> 00:26:59,580
(They were both dead.)

335
00:27:00,820 --> 00:27:01,260
(Your Highness,)

336
00:27:03,100 --> 00:27:03,700
(I'm leaving.)

337
00:27:11,300 --> 00:27:11,900
(Yan Shang,)

338
00:27:12,820 --> 00:27:13,500
(where are you?)

339
00:27:17,860 --> 00:27:18,620
(The clear water)

340
00:27:19,140 --> 00:27:20,620
(reflecting the clouds and trees.)

341
00:27:21,340 --> 00:27:22,220
(It's peaceful and lovely.)

342
00:27:41,420 --> 00:27:41,860
Yan Shang!

343
00:27:43,460 --> 00:27:43,940
Your Highness.

344
00:27:44,300 --> 00:27:44,780
Come with me!

345
00:28:03,660 --> 00:28:03,980
Hurry!

346
00:28:04,260 --> 00:28:04,620
Your Highness...

347
00:28:05,380 --> 00:28:05,700
Go!

348
00:28:15,020 --> 00:28:15,500
Your Highness...

349
00:28:17,060 --> 00:28:17,820
I've killed someone.

350
00:28:18,260 --> 00:28:18,620
Quiet!

351
00:28:19,900 --> 00:28:20,620
I can't get away.

352
00:28:21,420 --> 00:28:22,140
Fang Tong, go!

353
00:28:31,300 --> 00:28:32,260
I won't drag you down with me.

354
00:28:32,620 --> 00:28:33,300
Stop talking nonsense!

355
00:28:52,540 --> 00:28:53,500
(Who's there? Get down!)

356
00:29:03,740 --> 00:29:04,660
What bad luck!

357
00:29:05,220 --> 00:29:06,460
I'll have to burn incense all day!

358
00:29:11,700 --> 00:29:12,300
Aunt!

359
00:29:15,100 --> 00:29:15,740
Wanyao?

360
00:29:16,300 --> 00:29:16,860
You're here too.

361
00:29:17,540 --> 00:29:19,220
I heard someone
was killed in the garden!

362
00:29:19,660 --> 00:29:20,740
How terrifying!

363
00:29:22,100 --> 00:29:22,620
Aunt,

364
00:29:23,220 --> 00:29:24,860
can I go home early?

365
00:29:25,540 --> 00:29:26,820
There's blood everywhere.

366
00:29:27,180 --> 00:29:27,780
I really...

367
00:29:28,260 --> 00:29:30,180
Aunt, I really can't stand
the sight of blood!

368
00:29:31,020 --> 00:29:32,140
Let her go!

369
00:29:32,580 --> 00:29:33,300
Thank you, Aunt!

370
00:29:33,500 --> 00:29:34,220
You're the best!

371
00:29:49,780 --> 00:29:50,740
(Why is that carriage moving?)

372
00:29:51,940 --> 00:29:53,220
(Mr. Shen, easy.)

373
00:29:53,860 --> 00:29:56,420
(Malted milk cakes)

374
00:30:06,100 --> 00:30:06,780
Why did you kill him?

375
00:30:13,060 --> 00:30:13,860
For revenge.

376
00:30:14,380 --> 00:30:14,980
What revenge?

377
00:30:17,900 --> 00:30:19,220
Back when we were in Lingnan,

378
00:30:21,740 --> 00:30:22,860
I told Your Highness

379
00:30:23,780 --> 00:30:25,460
my family fled south

380
00:30:27,300 --> 00:30:28,500
to escape the Rebellion.

381
00:30:30,380 --> 00:30:31,740
Mother dead, younger brother killed.

382
00:30:34,740 --> 00:30:36,020
Father left crippled,
elder brother traumatized.

383
00:30:39,220 --> 00:30:40,380
As we fled south,

384
00:30:41,620 --> 00:30:43,300
we watched prosperous cities fall.

385
00:30:44,420 --> 00:30:45,420
Splendor turned to ashes.

386
00:30:47,580 --> 00:30:49,860
Corpses littered
the fields and wastelands.

387
00:30:51,340 --> 00:30:52,020
Some were soldiers,

388
00:30:53,740 --> 00:30:54,460
others ordinary folk.

389
00:30:56,620 --> 00:30:58,180
Wherever the rebel warlords went,

390
00:30:59,100 --> 00:30:59,940
they slaughtered the people first.

391
00:31:01,580 --> 00:31:02,460
Everyone fled in fear

392
00:31:03,660 --> 00:31:04,860
at their approach.

393
00:31:07,820 --> 00:31:08,940
We were lucky.

394
00:31:10,700 --> 00:31:11,820
We'd managed to escape them all.

395
00:31:18,700 --> 00:31:19,300
And then?

396
00:31:22,020 --> 00:31:22,580
Later,

397
00:31:26,820 --> 00:31:27,860
at that ruined temple,

398
00:31:29,300 --> 00:31:30,860
we ran into a squad of the Shence Army.

399
00:31:35,580 --> 00:31:36,220
We couldn't escape.

400
00:31:40,780 --> 00:31:41,700
They killed innocents
to claim military merit.

401
00:31:48,780 --> 00:31:49,700
The man who just died

402
00:31:50,780 --> 00:31:51,940
was Zhang Renjing.

403
00:31:54,940 --> 00:31:55,500
Back then,

404
00:31:58,260 --> 00:31:59,780
he was just a squad leader,

405
00:32:00,940 --> 00:32:02,180
roaming the area with his men,

406
00:32:02,420 --> 00:32:03,860
desperate to rack up kills.

407
00:32:04,580 --> 00:32:04,980
So...

408
00:32:07,460 --> 00:32:10,020
he cut the ears off innocent people,

409
00:32:10,100 --> 00:32:10,860
stuffed them into a sack,

410
00:32:12,380 --> 00:32:13,220
and claimed military merit.

411
00:32:14,100 --> 00:32:14,420
And then...

412
00:32:16,060 --> 00:32:16,900
he got his wish.

413
00:32:20,900 --> 00:32:21,940
So I killed him.

414
00:32:24,660 --> 00:32:25,820
He deserved to die long ago.

415
00:32:36,620 --> 00:32:37,380
I killed him.

416
00:32:39,180 --> 00:32:40,740
I killed him personally!

417
00:32:42,180 --> 00:32:42,820
I avenged them.

418
00:32:43,660 --> 00:32:44,700
I avenged my family.

419
00:32:52,940 --> 00:32:53,300
Yan Shang.

420
00:32:56,780 --> 00:32:57,340
Look at me.

421
00:32:58,740 --> 00:32:59,580
You've suffered so much.

422
00:33:01,300 --> 00:33:02,340
At last, you've cast off

423
00:33:02,940 --> 00:33:03,820
that heavy burden.

424
00:33:04,700 --> 00:33:06,180
I envy you for that.

425
00:33:08,180 --> 00:33:09,300
You've done right as a son

426
00:33:10,460 --> 00:33:11,100
and as a brother.

427
00:33:13,260 --> 00:33:14,140
If your mother

428
00:33:14,900 --> 00:33:16,140
and brother know from the afterlife,

429
00:33:17,700 --> 00:33:18,500
they can rest in peace.

430
00:33:25,980 --> 00:33:27,580
You've carried this burden for too long.

431
00:33:29,780 --> 00:33:31,140
It breaks my heart to see you like this.

432
00:33:34,340 --> 00:33:34,860
Don't be afraid.

433
00:33:38,500 --> 00:33:39,540
We're out of the garden now.

434
00:34:16,020 --> 00:34:16,660
(How much longer do we have to wait?)

435
00:34:16,660 --> 00:34:17,300
(Everyone, stand back!)

436
00:34:17,620 --> 00:34:17,940
(Exactly!)

437
00:34:18,060 --> 00:34:19,300
(One more step and I'll arrest you!)

438
00:34:19,420 --> 00:34:20,220
(Back off!)

439
00:34:20,300 --> 00:34:20,620
(You!)

440
00:34:20,660 --> 00:34:21,020
(Hurry!)

441
00:34:21,460 --> 00:34:22,100
(Back!)

442
00:34:22,180 --> 00:34:23,100
(We're only following orders!)

443
00:34:23,220 --> 00:34:23,900
(We have work to do!)

444
00:34:23,900 --> 00:34:24,860
(Quiet, or you'll all be arrested!)

445
00:34:25,620 --> 00:34:26,060
Your Highness,

446
00:34:26,340 --> 00:34:27,500
have you seen Princess Danyang?

447
00:34:27,820 --> 00:34:28,820
I've looked everywhere for her.

448
00:34:29,260 --> 00:34:29,620
Quiet!

449
00:34:29,620 --> 00:34:30,260
How dare you!

450
00:34:30,980 --> 00:34:32,820
How would I know where she is?

451
00:34:33,980 --> 00:34:35,220
How dare a maid of Princess Danyang

452
00:34:35,500 --> 00:34:36,660
defy her betters!

453
00:34:36,860 --> 00:34:37,540
(Don't crowd here!)

454
00:34:37,620 --> 00:34:38,380
(Everyone, stand back!)

455
00:34:39,220 --> 00:34:40,260
(Any more trouble, and I'll arrest you!)

456
00:34:40,260 --> 00:34:41,220
(Back! Move back!)

457
00:34:41,380 --> 00:34:41,900
(Back!)

458
00:34:41,900 --> 00:34:42,380
Wenji.

459
00:34:42,740 --> 00:34:43,340
Don't worry.

460
00:34:43,540 --> 00:34:44,260
I'll keep looking with you.

461
00:34:44,260 --> 00:34:44,660
(Back!)

462
00:34:44,980 --> 00:34:45,260
Let's go.

463
00:34:45,340 --> 00:34:45,700
(Back!)

464
00:34:47,100 --> 00:34:48,380
Just my luck!

465
00:34:48,580 --> 00:34:48,900
(Back!)

466
00:34:49,300 --> 00:34:50,180
Go ask them

467
00:34:50,300 --> 00:34:51,300
when they'll let us leave.

468
00:34:51,540 --> 00:34:51,860
(Back!)

469
00:34:52,020 --> 00:34:53,420
I just asked.

470
00:34:53,820 --> 00:34:56,060
Princess Luling is still furious.

471
00:34:56,540 --> 00:34:57,500
She's only a woman,

472
00:34:57,980 --> 00:34:58,900
and all she's got is...

473
00:35:02,620 --> 00:35:03,180
(Let us go!)

474
00:35:03,180 --> 00:35:03,900
(What did we do wrong?)

475
00:35:05,780 --> 00:35:06,900
(I swear, I know nothing!)

476
00:35:07,140 --> 00:35:07,700
(Why are you keeping us here?)

477
00:35:07,700 --> 00:35:08,620
(When will you let us go?)

478
00:35:08,620 --> 00:35:09,060
(Step back!)

479
00:35:09,300 --> 00:35:09,860
(Step back!)

480
00:35:10,100 --> 00:35:10,660
(Let us go!)

481
00:35:10,660 --> 00:35:11,060
(Back!)

482
00:35:12,980 --> 00:35:13,860
(No further!)

483
00:35:13,980 --> 00:35:14,420
(Everyone, stand back!)

484
00:35:14,420 --> 00:35:15,340
(Are you pushing us around?)

485
00:35:15,460 --> 00:35:16,340
(Everyone, back!)

486
00:35:19,020 --> 00:35:20,420
Your Highness,
we couldn't find the killer.

487
00:35:20,900 --> 00:35:21,340
Useless!

488
00:35:21,780 --> 00:35:22,740
Search again!

489
00:35:22,740 --> 00:35:23,060
Yes!

490
00:35:26,460 --> 00:35:26,740
Your Highness,

491
00:35:27,300 --> 00:35:28,460
we've searched
every corner of the garden.

492
00:35:28,820 --> 00:35:30,300
Another search would be pointless.

493
00:35:31,140 --> 00:35:32,660
Though we didn't catch the killer,

494
00:35:33,140 --> 00:35:34,380
we did detain several suspects.

495
00:35:35,020 --> 00:35:35,420
I'll send them

496
00:35:35,420 --> 00:35:36,700
to the Court of Judicial Review
for questioning

497
00:35:36,980 --> 00:35:38,220
and give Your Highness an answer.

498
00:35:38,740 --> 00:35:40,020
Then what are we waiting for?

499
00:35:40,620 --> 00:35:41,340
Back to my residence!

500
00:35:49,500 --> 00:35:50,580
Bring that Imperial Sacrifice official

501
00:35:50,580 --> 00:35:51,380
to the Court of Judicial Review.

502
00:35:51,900 --> 00:35:52,340
I'll question him myself.

503
00:35:53,580 --> 00:35:53,860
Yes, sir!

504
00:35:57,340 --> 00:35:57,700
Stand down!

505
00:36:01,660 --> 00:36:02,020
(They're letting us go!)

506
00:36:02,540 --> 00:36:03,020
(Let's get out of here.)

507
00:36:10,420 --> 00:36:11,020
(Where's Wanyao?)

508
00:36:11,980 --> 00:36:12,420
Chancellor,

509
00:36:12,900 --> 00:36:13,580
where are we going?

510
00:36:14,780 --> 00:36:15,980
South.

511
00:36:16,380 --> 00:36:17,260
Out of the city.

512
00:36:17,900 --> 00:36:18,220
(Got it.)

513
00:36:21,100 --> 00:36:26,140
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

514
00:36:29,980 --> 00:36:30,340
Come.

515
00:36:30,700 --> 00:36:31,260
Let's go home.

516
00:36:32,020 --> 00:36:32,460
Your Highness...

517
00:36:34,660 --> 00:36:35,260
I should be going.

518
00:36:36,580 --> 00:36:37,300
Where will you go?

519
00:36:40,220 --> 00:36:41,060
I've avenged my family,

520
00:36:41,540 --> 00:36:42,420
and thanks to Your Highness,

521
00:36:42,940 --> 00:36:43,660
I've escaped with my life.

522
00:36:44,620 --> 00:36:45,220
In this life,

523
00:36:45,780 --> 00:36:46,420
I have nothing more to ask for.

524
00:36:49,620 --> 00:36:50,500
I must return to Lingnan.

525
00:36:51,980 --> 00:36:52,820
You're leaving so soon?

526
00:36:58,780 --> 00:36:59,740
This cloak...

527
00:37:01,140 --> 00:37:01,700
You can keep it.

528
00:37:07,740 --> 00:37:08,460
It's dirty now.

529
00:37:09,300 --> 00:37:10,740
I can't return it like this.

530
00:37:11,980 --> 00:37:13,180
I'm afraid

531
00:37:14,220 --> 00:37:15,220
I can never repay you

532
00:37:16,020 --> 00:37:16,860
for saving my life.

533
00:37:24,340 --> 00:37:25,540
There's only one thing

534
00:37:27,060 --> 00:37:28,060
I can offer you in return.

535
00:37:52,820 --> 00:37:57,540
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

536
00:37:59,860 --> 00:38:00,340
Your Highness...

537
00:38:00,340 --> 00:38:03,460
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

538
00:38:03,460 --> 00:38:03,900
Take care.

539
00:38:07,260 --> 00:38:13,260
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

540
00:38:13,660 --> 00:38:13,940
Get out.

541
00:38:13,940 --> 00:38:19,100
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

542
00:38:21,540 --> 00:38:26,780
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

543
00:38:26,780 --> 00:38:29,540
♪Through trails of mud♪

544
00:38:29,540 --> 00:38:29,980
(Yan Shang,)

545
00:38:31,500 --> 00:38:32,700
(is this really all)

546
00:38:34,260 --> 00:38:35,300
(you want from this life?)

547
00:38:35,300 --> 00:38:39,900
♪- Soar with the wind; burning bright
- Plunge into hellfire as one♪

548
00:38:40,060 --> 00:38:43,500
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

549
00:38:43,740 --> 00:38:48,660
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

550
00:38:48,940 --> 00:38:53,620
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

551
00:38:53,780 --> 00:38:55,580
♪Not a single hour less♪

552
00:38:55,740 --> 00:38:59,480
♪However deep the snow♪

553
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:03,340
♪I'll wait if you're there♪

554
00:39:03,420 --> 00:39:06,820
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

555
00:39:06,980 --> 00:39:10,460
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

556
00:39:10,660 --> 00:39:17,460
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

557
00:39:17,740 --> 00:39:19,220
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

558
00:39:19,220 --> 00:39:22,260
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

559
00:39:22,340 --> 00:39:24,820
♪You're the only one I need♪

560
00:39:24,860 --> 00:39:27,980
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain♪
(Mingde Gate)

561
00:39:27,980 --> 00:39:32,060
♪Nothing can break us♪

562
00:39:32,220 --> 00:39:34,960
♪Be my one and only in this world;
be my one and only in this life♪

563
00:39:34,961 --> 00:39:35,500
(Mingde Gate)

564
00:39:35,580 --> 00:39:38,980
♪My last untouched innocence♪

565
00:39:47,860 --> 00:39:49,660
Young man, wait.

566
00:39:54,300 --> 00:39:54,860
Chancellor Liu.

567
00:39:57,500 --> 00:39:58,420
Don't forget,

568
00:39:59,380 --> 00:40:02,580
you still owe me a game of Go.

569
00:40:04,340 --> 00:40:05,780
Let's finish it before you go.

570
00:40:06,060 --> 00:40:06,740
What do you say?

571
00:40:08,940 --> 00:40:10,060
You waited here

572
00:40:10,780 --> 00:40:12,180
just to finish that game?

573
00:40:12,540 --> 00:40:13,060
That's right.

574
00:40:14,020 --> 00:40:15,980
Just for that game.

575
00:40:30,620 --> 00:40:32,260
Last time, you said

576
00:40:32,380 --> 00:40:35,500
you came to Sheng'an to right a wrong.

577
00:40:35,780 --> 00:40:37,740
Now that you're leaving,

578
00:40:38,180 --> 00:40:40,580
have you set things right?

579
00:40:44,580 --> 00:40:45,020
I have.

580
00:40:49,060 --> 00:40:52,580
Was killing Zhang Renjing really enough?

581
00:41:00,580 --> 00:41:01,540
To be frank,

582
00:41:02,540 --> 00:41:03,740
I'd seen you at the Imperial Academy

583
00:41:04,380 --> 00:41:05,300
long before we met.

584
00:41:05,820 --> 00:41:06,940
Out of curiosity,

585
00:41:07,300 --> 00:41:08,780
I looked into your background.

586
00:41:09,620 --> 00:41:10,940
I knew your father.

587
00:41:11,460 --> 00:41:12,620
He was good at poems

588
00:41:13,340 --> 00:41:14,700
and famous throughout the capital.

589
00:41:15,620 --> 00:41:17,020
I even met your mother

590
00:41:17,660 --> 00:41:20,180
at her parents' home before she married.

591
00:41:21,420 --> 00:41:23,380
What a remarkable woman,

592
00:41:23,860 --> 00:41:26,180
so free-spirited
and above worldly concerns.

593
00:41:29,580 --> 00:41:31,220
Such fine youths.

594
00:41:35,340 --> 00:41:36,060
But I digress.

595
00:41:37,140 --> 00:41:38,340
At my age,

596
00:41:38,540 --> 00:41:40,220
I tend to ramble.

597
00:41:41,260 --> 00:41:42,780
I waited here today

598
00:41:43,340 --> 00:41:44,980
to ask you just one thing:

599
00:41:45,460 --> 00:41:46,740
is it truly enough?

600
00:41:53,180 --> 00:41:53,980
Zhang Renjing dared

601
00:41:54,940 --> 00:41:56,500
to kill innocents for military merit

602
00:41:57,180 --> 00:42:00,060
because he served in the Shence Army.

603
00:42:00,660 --> 00:42:03,020
The Shence Army dares to kill at will

604
00:42:03,500 --> 00:42:07,140
because Yu Cheng'an controls the court.

605
00:42:07,460 --> 00:42:08,540
Even His Majesty

606
00:42:09,300 --> 00:42:10,980
has to bow to him.

607
00:42:11,700 --> 00:42:14,780
The court keeps showering
the Shence Army with rewards.

608
00:42:15,620 --> 00:42:17,860
Its officers can be promoted

609
00:42:18,220 --> 00:42:19,180
without even reporting.

610
00:42:20,060 --> 00:42:23,700
Even the censors dare not inspect it.

611
00:42:25,060 --> 00:42:27,100
Yu Cheng'an wields such power

612
00:42:27,580 --> 00:42:30,940
because His Majesty needs
his Shence Army

613
00:42:31,220 --> 00:42:32,860
to keep the regional warlords in check.

614
00:42:33,620 --> 00:42:34,500
As for the warlords,

615
00:42:34,980 --> 00:42:38,660
they've amassed troops
and grown restless.

616
00:42:38,900 --> 00:42:39,460
They've even demanded

617
00:42:40,260 --> 00:42:42,540
princesses into humiliating marriages

618
00:42:42,780 --> 00:42:46,300
just to buy the court a moment's peace.

619
00:42:48,020 --> 00:42:49,380
They'll rebel again

620
00:42:49,780 --> 00:42:54,500
at the slightest opportunity.

621
00:43:01,740 --> 00:43:03,220
Lord Yu controls the court,

622
00:43:04,540 --> 00:43:06,260
the warlords run rampant,

623
00:43:07,260 --> 00:43:08,780
and the officials turn a blind eye.

624
00:43:10,180 --> 00:43:11,380
You're right, Chancellor.

625
00:43:12,780 --> 00:43:14,260
Zhang Renjing wasn't the only one

626
00:43:15,420 --> 00:43:16,380
who made my family suffer.

627
00:43:17,300 --> 00:43:20,100
Nor was he the only one who slaughtered

628
00:43:21,260 --> 00:43:22,860
countless innocents.

629
00:43:31,260 --> 00:43:31,780
What a shame,

630
00:43:33,060 --> 00:43:34,380
I'm just a commoner.

631
00:43:36,420 --> 00:43:37,380
There's nothing I can do.

632
00:43:41,700 --> 00:43:46,300
(Next Episode Preview)

633
00:43:46,460 --> 00:43:47,180
Thank you, Your Highness.

634
00:43:47,860 --> 00:43:49,660
I'll probably need to
borrow from you a lot.

635
00:43:50,260 --> 00:43:52,500
Looking you over,

636
00:43:53,620 --> 00:43:54,900
that mouth is your only real asset.

637
00:43:55,380 --> 00:43:55,860
Make sure

638
00:43:56,420 --> 00:43:57,380
you put it to good use.

639
00:43:59,180 --> 00:44:01,320
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world♪

640
00:44:03,520 --> 00:44:06,813
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

641
00:44:09,498 --> 00:44:14,414
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

642
00:44:16,608 --> 00:44:22,453
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

643
00:44:22,953 --> 00:44:28,179
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

644
00:44:30,948 --> 00:44:35,739
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

645
00:44:36,575 --> 00:44:42,654
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

646
00:44:44,455 --> 00:44:47,605
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

647
00:44:47,605 --> 00:44:49,253
♪Burning bright as a song♪

648
00:44:49,305 --> 00:44:53,029
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

649
00:44:53,407 --> 00:44:58,073
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

650
00:44:58,692 --> 00:45:02,733
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

651
00:45:03,224 --> 00:45:05,339
♪Not a single hour less♪

652
00:45:05,379 --> 00:45:12,325
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

653
00:45:13,088 --> 00:45:16,541
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

654
00:45:16,721 --> 00:45:19,866
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

655
00:45:20,305 --> 00:45:26,942
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

656
00:45:27,339 --> 00:45:29,377
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

657
00:45:29,377 --> 00:45:31,853
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

658
00:45:31,891 --> 00:45:34,360
♪You're the only one I need♪

659
00:45:34,564 --> 00:45:41,451
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

660
00:45:41,763 --> 00:45:45,034
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

661
00:45:45,339 --> 00:45:48,512
♪My last untouched innocence♪

662
00:45:48,836 --> 00:45:52,262
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

663
00:45:52,495 --> 00:45:55,720
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

664
00:45:56,051 --> 00:46:02,847
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

665
00:46:03,216 --> 00:46:05,278
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

666
00:46:05,279 --> 00:46:07,782
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

667
00:46:07,829 --> 00:46:10,167
♪You're the only one I need♪

668
00:46:10,398 --> 00:46:17,233
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

669
00:46:17,582 --> 00:46:19,200
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

670
00:46:19,330 --> 00:46:21,126
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

671
00:46:21,483 --> 00:46:24,500
♪You're the only one I need♪

672
00:46:24,540 --> 00:46:25,867
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

